# Skills: Git

Purpose:
  Git skills for SDDRA system. Defines how git is used,
  including branching, commits, and hooks.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @semantic-commits.sdd
   3  @branching.sdd
   4  @hooks.sdd

Rules:
  [G1] All commits MUST follow semantic format.
  [G2] All branches MUST follow naming convention.
  [G3] All commits MUST pass pre-commit hooks.
  [G4] Never commit directly to master.
  [G5] All .sdd/ changes require owner approval.

Navigation:
  SemanticCommits: @semantic-commits.sdd
  Branching: @branching.sdd
  Hooks: @hooks.sdd

State: +
